Port of zortos293/Eglantine ee155a555b674592c0333f6ac9aa5bbbeba3b08f (#816),
including the exact/inexact, negative-constant, Scale overflow and global-store fixes.
Keep the 99zzzg1 cached Binding unchanged; resolve a separate per-dispatch write prefix.
Unknown stores disable all extents; grouped views retain their full shared mark.
EDEN_NX2_BOUND_COMPUTE_WRITES=0 forces full binding marks (default: extent enabled).
No frontend settings, UB-054 or UB-118.

